  "ruleText": "Plc 1001.23 Fees for Board-Sponsored Programs. The fee for attending a seminar sponsored by the mechanical licensing board shall be $100 per person.\n\nSource. #13677, eff 7-1-23; ss by #14289, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35 (previously Plc 1001.17(i))",
